OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA bright
OL,6,Fevening then staying mostly dry
OL,7,Fovernight with a few clear spells at
OL,8,Ftimes. Just the small chance of a few
OL,9,Fbrief showers developing.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FAnother very warm day.
OL,12,FMainly dry and bright with some sunny
OL,13,Fspells, though the sunshine turning
OL,14,Fhazy at times. Chance of the odd heavy
OL,15,Fshower.
